{
  "sequence_id": "seq_952f154fb1505883",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "man, I was doing so well. I really thought I had it nailed."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "But I guess there's nothing I can do about it now."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "See!? That right there!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "OKAWA, YOU'RE ALWAYS SO LAID BACK! WHERE'S YOUR THIRST FOR BLOOD?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Well, it's finally time. Us third years are retiring from the Equestrian Club today!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The first years' first competition is in October, so continue doing your best and make the club proud!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Right!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Yoda, we'd like you to take over as the next club president."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "And for the Vice- Presi- Dent..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I guess that makes sense. Yoda-san is the only second year here..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "They're going to make one of us first years the vice- president?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I bet it's going to be mikage."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "She's the best out of all of us here."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "One in five odds... Please don't let it be me ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "hachicken. We're counting on you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "MOO"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Moo"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "What!? Wait just a minute!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Con-grats!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Good luck, Hachiken!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hey, you made Vice- President!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Good luck!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Good work today, every- body!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yeah, great job guys!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yoda. Hachiken. You're taking over, so can you hang back for a minute?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Ehhh H!!!!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Why did you choose me?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yero Agricultural EQUESTR JOURN"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "There's no way you can tell me that Mikage isn't way better than I am!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "This is about being a team manager. It has nothing to do with how good you are."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Hachiken, you're honest with yourself and others, no matter what the situation is, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I guess... but I'm still against this, you know. I'm not even completely sure why I chose this school, either..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "See? That's exactly the honesty I was talking about."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T15",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But don't go bragging about things like that!"
    }
  ],
